{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5Baa-Baa Blitz: The Sheep\u2019s Kebab Incident</strong> is a fast-paced action platformer where momentum is everything and sheep are\u2026 highly flammable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dart, dash, and dive through vibrant, chaos-filled levels built for maximum speed and style. Nail tricky jumps, master gliding arcs, and blast your way through herds of unsuspecting livestock to keep your combo meter climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores or just enjoying the chaos, every course is a gauntlet of color, speed, and cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Speed-Powered Platforming</strong><br>Master tight turns, precision jumps, and aerial glides to chain together stylish runs and explosive shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Ramming is Rewarded</strong><br>Headbutt unsuspecting sheep for satisfying booms, bonus points, and pure dragon-fueled catharsis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Momentum is Everything</strong><br>Build speed by collecting coins, timing dashes, and chaining glides\u2014just don\u2019t blink or you\u2019ll miss your landing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882860?t=1754707877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882860/0bf2f3edd49367409d02830ee619b464675d90f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754707877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882860/5ad8434c8a03aa5c6f694aaf1601c52f3418ca9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754707877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882860/5ad8434c8a03aa5c6f694aaf1601c52f3418ca9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754707877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller suppor